OL,3,GNEWSACampervan fire damages homes and
OL,4,Acauses power cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn overnight campervan fire has damaged
OL,7,Fnearby homes and caused a power cut.
OL,9,FCrews were called to West Bay Road,
OL,10,FBridport, Dorset, at 02:26 BST where
OL,11,Fthe white campervan, parked on a
OL,12,Fdriveway, was well alight.
OL,14,FThe fire spread to two neighbouring
OL,15,Fhouses where windows, soffits and
OL,16,Fguttering were damaged, Dorset and
OL,17,FWiltshire Fire and Rescue Service said.
OL,19,FOverhead power cables were also
OL,20,Faffected, causing a power cut to the
OL,21,Ftwo properties, which have since been
OL,22,Freconnected.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
